OL,3,GNEWSADivers spend six hours clearing
OL,4,Ariver of waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team of divers from Northampton Scuba
OL,7,FSchool arranged a six-hour clean-up of
OL,8,Fthe River Nene in Northampton.
OL,10,FThey collected two old shopping
OL,11,Ftrolleys, a milk churn, a number of car
OL,12,Ftyres, an old bike, a drill and
OL,13,Fcharger.
OL,15,FThe event on Saturday 19 September was
OL,16,Forganised alongside Northampton Active
OL,17,Fand Northampton Rowing Club, with the
OL,18,Faim of clearing as much rubbish from
OL,19,Fthe river as possible.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
