OL,3,GNEWSADivers spend six hours clearing
OL,4,Ariver of waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers at Northampton Scuba School
OL,7,Fsaid they are committed to removing
OL,8,Fwaste from the River Nene on a regular
OL,9,Fbasis and plan to return in the coming
OL,10,Fmonths.
